r height and reach, and choose a low-impact option when you prefer it.\n\nReview your workout results and history on your headset. Calorie figures are estimates, not medical measurements.\n\nWorkout Worlds is a single-player experience with no subscription required. Play standing in a clear space with enough room to punch and move safely.", "short_description": "Work out somewhere different. Punch targets, dodge obstacles and move to original music on a sunny beach, in a green park, inside a gym or in a neon arena. You can also bring the workout into your own room with passthrough. Choose from 10 workouts, use controllers or hand tracking, and follow your progress on your headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://unagistudios.com/workout-worlds/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unagi Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://unagistudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1445217251999790"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1877027829948820"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1877027829948820"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791795900, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1877027829948820"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_te